OL,3,AThe #70 refund letter that isn't a scam
OL,4,
OL,5,FYou may be among the one million
OL,6,Fpeople, mostly women, who will receive
OL,7,Fletters explaining how you are eligible
OL,8,Ffor top-up pension payments - and it's
OL,9,Fnot a scam.
OL,11,FThose entitled are low earners who have
OL,12,Fmissed out on the money because of the
OL,13,Fway their pension is administered.
OL,15,FHM Revenue and Customs (HMRC) will
OL,16,Fwrite to people over the next few
OL,17,Fmonths, explaining how to receive the
OL,18,Fpayment. Typically they will be due
OL,19,F#70, but that may vary considerably
OL,20,Fdepending on their circumstances.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
