OL,3,AThe #70 refund letter that isn't a scam
OL,4,
OL,5,FAnyone eligible will be contacted
OL,6,Fautomatically but, if you receive a
OL,7,Fletter, there are various checks you
OL,8,Fcan do to ensure the letter is genuine
OL,9,Fso you don't get hoodwinked.
